cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Comparative Genomic Architecture of Klebsiella pneumoniae β-Lactamase Loci"
type: software
message: "Please cite the associated manuscript and the Zenodo data record when using this repository."
abstract: "Reproducible scripts for comparative analysis of blaIMP, blaKPC, blaNDM, blaTEM and blaSHV loci, including sequence extraction, metadata recovery, phylogenetic annotation, patristic-distance clustering, topological discordance, recombination breakpoint analysis and genomic-context visualization."
